Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

geocoder_client.geocode() only handled a status >= 500, so the fake's
404 for an unknown venue crashed on response.json() and POST
/api/meetups answered 500. A 404 now returns (None, None): the meetup is
created with 201 and null coordinates, as a real Nominatim's 200 [].
The contract gets a 404 example; test_meetups.py posts an unknown venue
and asserts the 201 and the null coordinates.

Hand-written L0 fixture for ticket 0013's attempt 1 (docs/adr/0038 §10):
the committed fake-test change. No model wrote it.
